WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.839
Roxy flew downtown and found Detective Smith.

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.191
He was in the middle of the road, chasing a chicken.

3
00:00:08.192 --> 00:00:11.527
Roxy flew down. "Hey, Detective!

4
00:00:11.528 --> 00:00:14.846
Why did the chicken cross the road?"

5
00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:18.806
"I don't know. Why?" Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:22.721
"Because you're chasing it!" Roxy said.

7
00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:26.329
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl," Detective Smith said.

8
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.139
"I'm only chasing it because it's in the road."

9
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.038
"Right." Roxy looked around.

10
00:00:32.039 --> 00:00:35.097
Farm animals were wandering between stopped cars.

11
00:00:35.098 --> 00:00:38.499
"Do you know where all these animals came from?"

12
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.926
"Nope," Detective Smith said.

13
00:00:40.927 --> 00:00:43.237
"They just appeared out of nowhere.

14
00:00:43.238 --> 00:00:46.803
And that's not even the strangest thing going on."

15
00:00:46.804 --> 00:00:49.546
"What do you mean?" Roxy asked.

16
00:00:49.547 --> 00:00:53.716
Detective Smith pointed behind her. "Look over there."

17
00:00:53.717 --> 00:00:58.142
Giant rows of corn were sprouting from the street and sidewalks.

18
00:00:58.143 --> 00:01:01.055
The corn was growing tall fast.

19
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:06.157
"Whoa!" Roxy thought. "The city is turning into a cornfield."

20
00:01:06.158 --> 00:01:08.718
She saw some cornstalks wiggle.

21
00:01:08.719 --> 00:01:11.544
She flew over to take a look.

22
00:01:11.545 --> 00:01:13.984
A car was stuck in the middle of the corn.

23
00:01:13.985 --> 00:01:16.949
A woman stood near the car.

24
00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.881
"Can you help me, Rocket Girl?"

25
00:01:19.882 --> 00:01:22.880
"What happened?" Roxy asked.

26
00:01:22.881 --> 00:01:27.427
"First, farm animals blocked my car," the woman said.

27
00:01:27.428 --> 00:01:30.736
"Then this corn popped up around me.

28
00:01:30.737 --> 00:01:34.067
I'm so late for work!"

29
00:01:34.068 --> 00:01:37.984
Roxy moved the woman's car out of the corn.

30
00:01:37.985 --> 00:01:39.918
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

31
00:01:39.919 --> 00:01:42.917
"No problem."

32
00:01:42.918 --> 00:01:46.558
Roxy took off, flying above the city to get a better look.

33
00:01:46.559 --> 00:01:49.123
Soon she saw something strange.

34
00:01:49.124 --> 00:01:51.699
A big man was reaching into bags of seeds.

35
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:57.667
Shwoop! Shwoop! Everywhere he dropped seeds, new cornstalks sprouted.

36
00:01:57.668 --> 00:02:00.640
Roxy landed near the man.

37
00:02:00.641 --> 00:02:02.609
"Who are you?"

38
00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.871
"Hee-haw!" the man said.

39
00:02:05.872 --> 00:02:08.368
He was wearing overalls and a straw hat.

40
00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:11.334
"I'm Barnyard Billy."

41
00:02:11.335 --> 00:02:16.511
"Why are you planting corn in the streets of Metro City?" Roxy asked.

42
00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:18.526
Barnyard Billy frowned.

43
00:02:18.527 --> 00:02:23.196
"I'm a farmer. Just like my daddy and my daddy's daddy.

44
00:02:23.197 --> 00:02:25.947
My animals and I were happy.

45
00:02:25.948 --> 00:02:31.450
Then city people stole my land, and I lost my farm!"

46
00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:33.328
He clenched his fist.

47
00:02:33.329 --> 00:02:39.032
"And they built all these ugly buildings and roads!"

48
00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:42.375
"That's too bad about your farm," Roxy said.

49
00:02:42.376 --> 00:02:45.358
"But you're causing problems for people."

50
00:02:45.359 --> 00:02:49.074
"Who cares!" Billy snapped.

51
00:02:49.075 --> 00:02:53.849
"I created a special, fast-growing corn for revenge.

52
00:02:53.850 --> 00:03:00.224
I'm going to turn Metro City into one gigantic farm!"

53
00:03:00.225 --> 00:03:05.344
Billy whistled loudly.

54
00:03:05.345 --> 00:03:09.534
Roxy gulped as live scarecrows stepped out of the cornfield.

55
00:03:09.535 --> 00:03:14.839
"Guess what, boys!" Billy laughed.

56
00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:22.867
"It's time to scare somebody away—Rocket Girl!"

